              "@id": "urn:uuid:fabebfbd-6c74-54dc-ac17-b07344534b67",
              "@type": "uco-observable:ExtractedString",
              "uco-observable:stringValue": "Query Reports Utilities Help Log Out\n\nU.S. District Court [LIVE]\nWestern District of Texas (El Paso)\nCRIMINAL DOCKET FOR CASE #: 3:25-cr-01046-KC All Defendants\n\nCase title: USA v. Herrera Date Filed: 05/14/2025\n\nAssigned to: Judge Kathleen Cardone\n\nDefendant (1)\nSeth Herrera\n\nPending Counts Disposition\n18:2251.F Attempted Sexual Exploitation of a Minor\n(1)\n18:2252.F Receipt of a Visual Depiction Involving the Sexual Exploitation of a Minor\n(2)\n\nHighest Offense Level (Opening)\nFelony\n\nTerminated Counts Disposition\nNone\n\nHighest Offense Level (Terminated)\nNone\n\nComplaints Disposition\nNone\n\nPlaintiff\nUSA represented by Mallory Josephine Rasmussen\nU.S. Attorney's Office\n700 E. San Antonio Ave.\nSuite 200\nEl Paso, TX 79901\n915-356-2228\nEmail: mallory.rasmussen@usdoj.gov\nLEAD ATTORNEY\nATTORNEY TO BE NOTICED\n\nPatricia Josefina Acosta\nAssistant U.S. Attorney\n700 E. San Antonio\n2nd Floor\nEl Paso, TX 79901\n(915) 534-6884\nFax: 915/534-6024\nEmail: patricia.acosta@usdoj.gov\nLEAD ATTORNEY\nATTORNEY TO BE NOTICED\n\nRachel Lieber Rothberg\nDOJ-Crm\nChild Exploitation and Obscenity Section\n1301 New York Ave NW\nSte 11th Fl\nWashington, DC 20530\n202-603-9145\nEmail: rachel.rothberg@usdoj.gov\nLEAD ATTORNEY\nATTORNEY TO BE NOTICED\n\nDate Filed # Docket Text\n05/14/2025 If ordered by the court, all referrals will be assigned to Magistrate Judge Castaneda (bot2) (Entered: 05/14/2025)\n05/14/2025 1 INDICTMENT (Redacted Version) with Notice of Forfeiture included as to Seth Herrera. Unredacted document sealed pursuant to E-Government Act of 2002 as to Seth Herrera (1) count(s) 1, 2. (bot1) (Entered:\n05/14/2025)\n05/14/2025 3 Personal Data Sheet (SEALED) as to Seth Herrera (bot2) (Entered: 05/14/2025)\n05/14/2025 6 MOTION to Detain Defendant without Bond by USA as to Seth Herrera. (ep1) (Entered: 05/15/2025)\n05/15/2025 5 MOTION for Leave to File Sealed Document (Attachments: # 1 Proposed Order) (Rasmussen, Mallory) (Entered: 05/15/2025)\n05/16/2025 8 NOTICE OF ATTORNEY APPEARANCE Rachel Lieber Rothberg appearing for USA. . Attorney Rachel Lieber Rothberg added to party USA(pty:pla) (Rothberg, Rachel) (Entered: 05/16/2025)\n05/16/2025 Text Order GRANTING 5 Motion for Leave to File Sealed Document as to Seth Herrera (1) Entered by Judge Kathleen Cardone. (This is a text-only entry generated by the court. There is no document associated with this\nentry.) (KC) (Entered: 05/16/2025)\n05/16/2025 9 SEALED MOTION filed (Attachments: # 1 Proposed Order) (ep1) (Entered: 05/16/2025)\n05/16/2025 10 Sealed Order. Signed by Judge Kathleen Cardone. (ep1) (Entered: 05/16/2025)\n05/22/2025 11 NOTICE OF ATTORNEY APPEARANCE Patricia Josefina Acosta appearing for USA. NOTICE OF ATTORNEY APPEARANCE. Attorney Patricia Josefina Acosta added to party USA(pty:pla) (Acosta, Patricia) (Entered:\n05/22/2025)\n06/16/2025 12 NOTICE ADVISORY TO THE COURT REGARDING FORFEITURE by USA as to Seth Herrera (Acosta, Patricia) (Entered: 06/16/2025)\n01/30/2026 13 NOTICE Advisory to the Court regarding Defendant's Parallel Proceedings by USA as to Seth Herrera (Rothberg, Rachel) (Entered: 01/30/2026)\n06/12/2026 14 NOTICE of Consent to Transfer under Rule 20 for Plea and Sentence by USA as to Seth Herrera (Rothberg, Rachel) (Entered: 06/12/2026)\n\nPACER Service Center\nTransaction Receipt\n06/13/2026 21:14:45\nPACER\nmrinaal_ramachandran Client Code:\nLogin:\nSearch 3:25-cr-01046-\nDescription: Docket Report\nCriteria: KC\nBillable\n2 Cost: 0.20\nPages:"
            }
